[[build-streaming]]
=== Streaming and memory mapping

**STUB**: Specifies streams: values too large or too long-lived to hold in
memory at once. Defines the stream file format, how it is divided into chunks,
and how the chunks are compressed, including write-behind compression. Covers
how readers map a stream into memory and access it at random, which element
types and variants a stream may hold, and the guarantees for a stream that is
still being written.

